---
import { siteConfig } from "../config";
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anek+Devanagari:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />

    <title>Terms & Conditions</title>
  </head>

  <body class="bg-white text-gray-800">

    <!-- MAIN -->
    <section class="px-6 sm:px-10 md:px-16 lg:px-24 py-12 md:py-16 lg:py-20">

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-20 items-start">

        <!-- LEFT -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-4">

          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl xl:text-7xl font-bold text-gray-900">
            Terms of Service.
          </h2>

          <div
            class="w-[75px] h-[5px] mt-2 rounded-full"
            style={`background-color: ${siteConfig.accentColor}`}
          ></div>

          <p class="text-gray-500 mt-5 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-sm leading-relaxed">
            The main rules and responsibilities for using this website or working with me.
          </p>

        </div>

        <!-- RIGHT -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-8 w-full min-w-0">

          <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl 
                      p-6 sm:p-8 md:p-10 lg:p-12
                      shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300">

            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mb-6">
              Last updated: August 2026
            </p>

            <div class="space-y-8 text-lg sm:text-xl md:text-xl leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
            
              <p>
                By using this website or working with me, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please stop using the website and services.
              </p>
            
              <p>
                All original content on this website, including text, branding, custom visuals, and layout, is protected by copyright and other applicable laws. You may not copy or reuse it without written permission.
              </p>
            
              <p>
                I provide services based on an agreed project plan. We confirm the price, timeline, and files you will receive before work begins. New requests may need an extra fee or more time.
              </p>
            
              <p>
                An advance payment may be required to reserve your project. I deliver final files after full payment. Unless we agree otherwise in writing, payments are non-refundable after work begins.
              </p>
            
              <p>
                The number of revisions depends on your package or agreement. Minor changes are included; a major change in direction may be treated as new work.
              </p>
            
              <p>
                Delivery dates are estimates and may change based on project complexity and how quickly I receive feedback. I am not responsible for delays caused by missing information or late replies.
              </p>
            
              <p>
                You are responsible for making sure that the content, materials, and assets you provide are yours or properly licensed. You are responsible for any legal issues caused by those materials.
              </p>
            
              <p>
                After final payment, you receive usage rights for the final files unless we agree otherwise. I may still show completed work in my portfolio, social media, or promotional materials.
              </p>
            
              <p>
                I work to provide reliable, high-quality services, but services are provided "as is" and cannot be guaranteed to meet every expectation or work perfectly in every situation. I am not responsible for indirect losses, damage, or business impact caused by using the delivered work.
              </p>
            
              <p>
                This website may link to third-party platforms or tools. I am not responsible for their content, policies, or practices.
              </p>
            
              <p>
                I may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the website or services after an update means you accept the revised terms.
              </p>
            
              <!-- CONTACT -->
              <div class="pt-6">
                <p class="text-gray-500 text-base sm:text-lg">
                  Questions about these terms?
                </p>
            
                <p class="text-gray-900 font-medium mt-1">
                  {siteConfig.social.email}
                </p>
              </div>
            
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>

  </body>
</html>
